@startuml
title Persistence - Local JSON Storage
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

component "AbstractLocalPersistence\nlocking + atomic replace" as base
component "LocalPersonaPersistence" as personas
component "LocalDiscussionPersistence" as discussions
component "LocalDiscussionTemplatePersistence" as templates
component "LocalConfigurationPersistence" as configuration
database "data/personas.json" as personaFile
database "data/discussions.json" as discussionFile
database "data/discussion_templates.json" as templateFile
database "data/configuration.json" as configurationFile

personas --|> base
discussions --|> base
templates --|> base
configuration --|> base
personas --> personaFile
discussions --> discussionFile
templates --> templateFile
configuration --> configurationFile

note right of discussions
Stores complete runs:
topic, strategy, personas,
configuration, messages,
status and result.
end note
note right of templates
Stores reusable setup snapshots:
name, topic, strategy,
persona IDs and configuration.
end note
@enduml
